  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Staff Selection Commission, SSC</a> </span>has released the Final Answer Key/ Marks for the post of Head Constable AWO/ TPO Male &amp; Female on the official website of SSC. This recruitment was released for 443 posts. Applications for the Delhi Police Head Constable (AWO/ TPO) Recruitment 2025 were accepted from September 22, 2025, to October 31, 2025. The CBT examination was held on 15-22 January 2026. Candidates who appeared for this examination can download their Delhi Police Head Constable (AWO/ TPO) Final Answer Key/ Marks 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Staff Selection Commission (SSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Delhi Police Head Constable (AWO/ TPO) Result 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>24 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>15 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"colo