er;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.9523%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">185</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.2701%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">78</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 21.3165%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.9523%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">37</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.2701%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">13</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 21.3165%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">OBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.9523%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">94</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.2701%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">47</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 21.3165%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.9523%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">48</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.2701%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">23</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 21.3165%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.9523%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">33</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.2701%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">16</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 21.3165%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Total</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.9523%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>370</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.2701%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>182</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>SSC Delhi Police Head Constable (AWO/ TPO) Recruitment 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates who have Passed Class 12th (Intermediate) Exam With Science &amp; Mathematics as subjects form any recognized board <strong>OR </strong>National Trade Certificate (NTC) in the trade of Mechanic-cum Operator Electronic Communication System <strong>&amp;&nbsp;</strong>should have Knowledge Of Computer Working will be eligible for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Knowledge of Computer, English Word Processing Speed : 1000 Key Depressions in 15 Mins.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Delhi Police Head Constable (AWO/ TPO) Recruitment 2025 : Physical Measurement Test</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Measurement</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Male</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Female</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Height</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">170 CM (Relaxation as per rules)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">157 CM (Relaxation as per rules)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Chest</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">81-85 CM (Relaxation as per rules)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">NA</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Delhi Police Head Constable (AWO/ TPO) Recruitment 2025 : PET Eligibility (Male)</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Race 1600 M</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Long Jump</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>High Jump</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Up to 30 Years</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">07 Minutes</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">12.6 Feet</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">3.6 Feet</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">30-40 Years</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">08 Minutes</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">11.6 Feet</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">3.3 Feet</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Above 40 Years</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">09 Minutes</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">10.6 Feet</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">03 Feet</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Delhi Police Head Constable (AWO/ TPO) Recruitment 2025 : PET Eligibility (Female)</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Race 800 M</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Long Jump</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>High Jump</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Up to 30 Years</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: